Z||000046||Mach10||04-11-2001||12:05 AM||||Here's mine:<BR>-Treat others with dignity and respect.<BR>-Stand up for yourself<BR>-Keep an open mind.<BR>-Going fast is only a crime in residential areas<BR>-Sin is just treating people like things.<BR>-Money isn't everything. Try and make do with what you have, and when you get it, try not to inflate it above what it is (THAT GOES FOR ALL RICERS  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>-If you make it big, remember your humble roots.<BR>-If you made it, and are now humble, remember what you had, and move on<BR>-Love may not happen only once, but if it does.... s-w-e-e-t  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR>-ALWAYS speak your mind. Even if your mouth is already full of feet.<BR>-Take a martial art, for fitness and self-defence (see point above)<P><BR>||||reg||1
